{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJspoOiJoeBjQIaPjZVb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"What I still need next, privately:\n\n1. Whether my earlier probe left stray nodes on the workspace page, and the exact `reactions` schema (the tool rejected the singular `action` field, so I must confirm the `actions` array form before wiring 12 screens).\n2. Whether linking by `destinationId` accepts a top-level frame and whether overlay navigation stores an overlay position — both affect how the sheets and dialog are wired.\n3. A look at the Logo artwork, to decide whether it needs a tinted container on light surfaces.\n4. A look at the icon set's stroke style, since I'll recolor instances.\n5. A look at the generated images, to choose crop ratios for the image grid and thumbnails.\n\nItems 1 and 2 come from one write-and-read-back probe. Items 3–5 are three independent screenshots. Nothing here depends on another result, so I'll request all four in this response."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2723,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":38272,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2723}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"79e4a8c2-208e-41cc-9c26-d4519dca7846","uuid":"a230ae13-3676-4b39-b6b9-55cf7ec99afa","timestamp":"2026-10-30T18:48:59.666Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJspoOiJoeBjQIaPjZVb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01U2MU4rUo7qpsk1tHvtJCr5","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('5:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst leftovers = page.children.map(c=>({id:c.id,name:c.name,type:c.type}));\nfor (const c of page.children) { try { const n = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(c.id); if (/__probe|Logo/.test(n.name)) n.remove(); } catch(e){} }\nconst f = figma.createFrame(); page.appendChild(f); f.name='__probe2'; f.resize(80,80);\nconst g = figma.createFrame(); page.appendChild(g); g.name='__probe3'; g.resize(80,80);\nlet res={};\ntry{\n  f.reactions = [{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'}, actions:[{type:'NODE', destinationId:g.id, navigation:'NAVIGATE', transition:null, preserveScrollPosition:false}]}];\n  g.reactions = [{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'}, actions:[{type:'NODE', destinationId:f.id, navigation:'OVERLAY', transition:null, preserveScrollPosition:false, overlayRelativePosition:{x:0,y:300}}]}];\n  res.nav = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(f.reactions));\n  res.ov = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(g.reactions));\n}catch(e){res.err=String(e);}\nf.remove(); g.remove();\nreturn {leftovers, res, finalChildren: page.children.length};","description":"Clean probe nodes and validate reactions schema for navigate and overlay","fileKey":"9heKhkdl3nBs0098pOlkYl"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2723,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":38272,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2723}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"79e4a8c2-208e-41cc-9c26-d4519dca7846","uuid":"056d5c67-2dbb-4606-ac74-8572a4ce95c4","timestamp":"2026-10-30T18:49:01.102Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu