{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJswK1A9oYImSEapXuJu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for a design-system and build plan for a chat-assistant app. I work through the concrete quantities and decisions.\n\nThe first step is confirming the reactions schema. The earlier error says `overlayRelativePosition` is only valid when the destination frame has `overlayPosition = 'MANUAL'`. So a NAVIGATE reaction with ON_CLICK plus actions works as-is, and an overlay reaction needs the destination frame set to `'MANUAL'` first. Once that property is set, the overlay with position is available.\n\nNext I check the broader frame property set: `overlayPosition`, `fixed`, `overflowDirection`, `clipsContent`, `layoutSizing`. Then the plugin runtime: creating text in Bricolage Grotesque and Nunito, and loading those fonts. Copying media instances across pages already works with `createInstance`, so that path is safe.\n\nThe brand hex checks out: 0.3803921 × 255 = 97, 0.1647059 × 255 = 42, 0.4549020 × 255 = 116, giving #612A74.\n\nThe palette follows from that: primary #612A74, pressed #4B1F5B, tint 8% #F3EBF6 / 4% #F8F4FA, ink #17141A, body #4A4450, muted #786E80, border #E4DEE8, surface #FFFFFF, background #F7F4F9, success #1E9E6A, warning #E0952B, error #D2453C, disabled #C9C2CF. Storage colors: Chats #612A74, Images #A87BC0, Exports #E8C88C.\n\nType: Bricolage Grotesque for display/headings, Nunito for UI/body. Scale: Display 28/32 Bricolage SemiBold, H1 24, H2 20, Body 16 Nunito, Small 14, Caption 12 uppercase with tracking.\n\nCanvas is 428×928 across 12 frames. Layout constants: status bar 0–47, home indicator 894–928. Frames sit in a grid at x = 600, 1100, 1600, 2100 and y = 200, 1228, 2256 (428 + 60 gap horizontally, 928 + 100 vertically).\n\nThe component library lives in a SECTION named \"Components · Chat Bot AI\" rather than extra frames, since SECTIONS are not frames and the count stays at 12. Components: status bar (3:34), home indicator (3:45), Button (primary/secondary/destructive/ghost × default/pressed/disabled, seeded from the 3:24 instance), Text Field (default/filled/focused/password, from 3:29), View Tab, Chat List Item, Image Tile (185×185, `clipsContent`, cover-scaled instance), Export Row, Message Bubble (user/assistant), Setting Row, Icon Button. Image aspect ratios differ (Gen_Mug 200×200, Gen_Rat 133×200, Gen_Statue 300×200, Gen_Student 281×200), so each tile needs a centered cover crop.\n\nScreens: 01_Login, 02_Home_Chats, 03_Home_Images, 04_Home_Exports, 05_Chat_New, 06_Chat_Conversation, 07_Export_PDF_Sheet, 08_Profile_Settings, 09_Account_Actions_Sheet, 10_Theme_Sheet, 11_Cloud_Space, 12_Clear_Cache_Dialog.\n\nLogin geometry: fields 380 wide at x=24; logo 96 at y≈100, title at 232, email label 320/field 340, password 412/432, forgot 496, login 528, divider 608, social 644, footer 700, legal 860.\n\n06 is built as a scrolled-to-bottom state: story clipped to ~200px with a fade so all four senders stay identified, image 150 tall, input bar 800–870. Sheets 07, 09, 10, 12 use OVERLAY with `overlayPosition = 'MANUAL'`, falling back to NAVIGATE if rejected.\n\nPrototype links: 01→02; 02→05 (New Topic), →06 (chat item), →03, →04, →08 (avatar); 03/04 cross-tab and →05; 05 menu→02; 06 menu→02, export→07; 07 close/Export→06; 08 back→02, more→09, Theme→10, Data & storage→11; 09 Sign out→01; 11 back→08, Clear cache→12; 12 Cancel/Delete→11.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":7430,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":40995,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7430}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"79e4a8c2-208e-41cc-9c26-d4519dca7846","uuid":"8de05efc-2fca-48f2-af37-433a6a004658","timestamp":"2026-10-30T18:51:35.438Z","thinking_duration_ms":132784}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJswK1A9oYImSEapXuJu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"What I still need next, privately:\n\n1. A working reaction schema — the overlay form was rejected, so I must confirm NAVIGATE alone is accepted and whether `overlayPosition='MANUAL'` unlocks overlays. I'll settle this with a probe that also confirms frame properties I'll rely on (`clipsContent`, `overlayPosition`).\n2. Whether the given Button and Text Field can be instanced with text overrides intact, so my component set matches the given default exactly.\n\nBoth are quick write-and-read-back probes with nothing else depending on them, so I'll run them together."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":7430,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":40995,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7430}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"79e4a8c2-208e-41cc-9c26-d4519dca7846","uuid":"3bbf0429-7100-451a-968f-767fbcdbd639","timestamp":"2026-10-30T18:51:38.763Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJswK1A9oYImSEapXuJu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EQ3awQTpRlveVsPbmxDBoL","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const P = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('5:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(P);\nconst f = figma.createFrame(); P.appendChild(f); f.name='__p1'; f.resize(200,100);\nconst g = figma.createFrame(); P.appendChild(g); g.name='__p2'; g.resize(200,100);\nlet out={};\ntry{ f.reactions=[{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},actions:[{type:'NODE',destinationId:g.id,navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:null,preserveScrollPosition:false}]}]; out.nav=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(f.reactions)); }catch(e){out.navErr=String(e);}\nlet props={}; for (const k of ['overlayPosition','overlayBackground','overlayBackgroundInteraction','clipsContent','layoutMode','layoutSizingHorizontal','itemReverseZIndex','strokesIncludedInLayout']) { try{ props[k]=g[k]; }catch(e){ props[k]='ERR'; } }\ntry{ g.overlayPosition='MANUAL'; out.overlayManualSet=String(g.overlayPosition); }catch(e){ out.overlayManualErr=String(e); }\ntry{ g.reactions=[{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},actions:[{type:'NODE',destinationId:f.id,navigation:'OVERLAY',transition:null,preserveScrollPosition:false,overlayRelativePosition:{x:0,y:200}}]}]; out.ov=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(g.reactions)); }catch(e){ out.ovErr=String(e); }\n// button instance override test\nlet bo={};\ntry{ const b=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('3:24'); const i=b.createInstance(); P.appendChild(i); i.name='__btn'; const t=i.findOne(n=>n.type==='TEXT'); t.characters='Sign out'; bo={ok:true,label:t.characters,font:t.fontName,w:i.width}; i.remove(); }catch(e){bo={err:String(e)};}\nf.remove(); g.remove();\nreturn {out, props, bo, children:P.children.map(c=>c.name)};","description":"Probe overlay positioning, frame properties and button text override","fileKey":"9heKhkdl3nBs0098pOlkYl"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":7430,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":40995,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7430}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"79e4a8c2-208e-41cc-9c26-d4519dca7846","uuid":"28d12c1a-2644-4ba3-b743-c9fc1b2cb7f0","timestamp":"2026-10-30T18:51:42.509Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01EQ3awQTpRlveVsPbmxDBoL","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
