time right-aligned on the first line.\n\nFor 03 I use a 3-column grid with tile 118 and gap 12, giving 3 rows of 130 = 390, so 8 images fit from 330 to 720. For 04 seven export rows at about 72 each fill 504 below the same hero.\n\nFor 05: header 47-119, hero 160-360 with a 72 logo, \"Chat Bot AI 4.5\" at 26, a Premium pill and the greeting, then four 380×72 suggestion cards from 380 to 704, and a bottom input bar with an \"Ask me anything...\" pill plus a 48px send circle at 820-884.\n\nFor 06 I budget: user bubble 1 at 124-196, AI label 206-226, story block 226-356 clipped to 6 lines with a fade, copy/share/regenerate actions 356-378, user bubble 2 at 392-520 using 14/19 text, AI label 528-548, final text 548-592, the generated image 250×178 from 592-780, image actions 780-800, input 820-884. Sheets 07, 09 and 10 sit over dimmed copies of their parents inside separate frames, reached by NAVIGATE, since overlay positioning is unavailable.\n\nFor 11 I stack: header 100, usage card 112-220 with a 96 donut split Chats/Images/Exports, Images card 232-382 with 169 items, 8,225 MB and 7 thumbnails at 44, Exports card 394-600 with 37 items and 506 MB plus 3 rows, delete-all-chats 612-700, clear cache 700-756, footer 780-860. For 12 a 340-wide centered dialog over the dimmed cloud space carries Cancel and Delete.\n\nI write one JS call per pair of screens with helpers redefined each time, then wire the prototype and take screenshots for fixes.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2355,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":63451,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2355}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"79e4a8c2-208e-41cc-9c26-d4519dca7846","uuid":"9a1a14ff-1767-45ca-9186-86fa970f4ac9","timestamp":"2026-10-30T18:55:01.850Z","thinking_duration_ms":165457}
