eet, 11_Cloud_Space, and 12_Clear_Cache_Dialog. The sheet frames clone the parent's children with `.clone()` so 07 copies 06, 09 and 10 copy 08, and 12 copies 11.\n\nThe layout math for 02_Home_Chats: 47 for the status bar, header at 52 with 40px back and avatar, hero at 100 with a 40px logo at x=24, New Topic button at 172 (380×56), \"History\" heading at 240, search field 380×44 at 272, tab row at 328, and 7 chat items of 72 each from 380 to 884, with the home indicator at 894. The total fits inside 928.\n\nFor 05_Chat_New the greeting sits at y=330 with width 340, the 4 suggestion cards run 420 to 708 at 64 plus 8 gap, and the input bar spans 792 to 884. For 06_Chat_Conversation the messages are user1 (~70), the clipped AI story (~170), user2 (~110), and the image reply (~270), which lands at about 750 against a 100 header.\n\nPrototype reactions use NAVIGATE for every link, since overlay positioning is not settable. Text truncation uses `textTruncation = 'ENDING'` with `maxLines` set, wrapped in try/catch.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":1261,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":88881,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1261}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"79e4a8c2-208e-41cc-9c26-d4519dca7846","uuid":"044ea66e-2cd5-4a92-bfcf-a4280b17174d","timestamp":"2026-10-30T18:57:08.975Z","thinking_duration_ms":58036}
