{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJuivIwkwWBtw8wswzDE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking why reactions with `transition: null` fail validation on `actions[0]` when an earlier probe with the identical shape succeeded. Let me set the facts side by side: the successful probe used `{type:'NODE', destinationId, navigation:'NAVIGATE', transition:null, preserveScrollPosition:false}` and set on a plain frame f with a FRAME destination g; it echoed `resetVideoPosition` and `resetScrollPosition`, i.e. normalized defaults. Now all 8 calls fail though destinations are FRAME too. Instances themselves work, since \"login\" (instance) succeeded earlier (counts: login 2, home 5). The earlier rewire attempt with a transition object carrying easing `{type:'EASE_OUT'}` also failed, so a transition object is not the fix. The common factor across the 8 failures is the shape, not the node type. I test one node with several shapes and report which validates: A omits transition entirely, B passes `transition:null` without `preserveScrollPosition`, C passes `resetScrollPosition: true`. Separately I capture screenshot 20:333.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":5081,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":186542,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5081}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"79e4a8c2-208e-41cc-9c26-d4519dca7846","uuid":"704663f9-404d-4d81-92e9-a4195344e70c","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:12:06.656Z","thinking_duration_ms":14193}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJuivIwkwWBtw8wswzDE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"What I still need, privately:\n\n1. **A valid `actions` payload.** All eight failed links fail schema validation regardless of whether `transition` is null or an object, so the accepted shape must be something else. I'll probe several payload variants on one node and report the first that validates.\n2. **A look at 09_Account_Actions_Sheet**, the one sheet I lifted but have not re-checked, since its Cancel row sits close to the home indicator.\n\nThose two are independent of each other, so both go in this response."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":5081,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":186542,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5081}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"79e4a8c2-208e-41cc-9c26-d4519dca7846","uuid":"c8472ba9-07f2-42e8-b2a4-f8416ea66e15","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:12:09.625Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJuivIwkwWBtw8wswzDE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01mBYTqjZmfWPxYC89XoO18x","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const target=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('15:20'); // 01_Login\nconst dest='15:75';\nconst btn=target.findAll(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE'&&/^Button\\/Primary/.test(n.name))[0];\nconst attempts={};\nconst shapes=[\n ['A_omitTransition', {trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},actions:[{type:'NODE',destinationId:dest,navigation:'NAVIGATE'}]}],\n ['B_nullNoPreserve', {trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},actions:[{type:'NODE',destinationId:dest,navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:null}]}],\n ['C_preserveTop', {trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},actions:[{type:'NODE',destinationId:dest,navigation:'NAVIGATE',preserveScrollPosition:false}]}],\n ['D_navigationOnly', {trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},actions:[{type:'NODE',destinationId:dest,navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:null,preserveScrollPosition:false,resetScrollPosition:false}]}],\n ['E_bothFields', {trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},actions:[{type:'NODE',destinationId:dest,navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:null,preserveScrollPosition:false,resetVideoPosition:false}]}]\n];\nfor(const [name,val] of shapes){\n  try{ btn.reactions=[val]; attempts[name]='OK'; break; }\n  catch(e){ attempts[name]=String(e).slice(0,90); }\n}\nlet stored=null; try{ stored=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(btn.reactions)); }catch(e){ stored=String(e); }\nreturn {attempts, stored};","description":"Probe accepted reaction action payload shape","fileKey":"9heKhkdl3nBs0098pOlkYl"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":5081,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":186542,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5081}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"79e4a8c2-208e-41