{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJvvcGyO0EQtYU8Mu7Az","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything needed is now in hand, and no item remains that depends on another result, so there is nothing further to request. The build is complete and verified.\n\n**File:** https://www.figma.com/design/9heKhkdl3nBs0098pOlkYl/\n**Workspace page:** `03 · Workspace` — `5:2`\n\n**Screens** (all 428 × 928, exact brief names, 3 + 4 grid plus a component section):\n\n| Frame | ID |\n|---|---|\n| 01_Login | `15:20` |\n| 02_Home_Chats | `15:75` |\n| 03_Home_Images | `16:63` |\n| 04_Home_Exports | `16:133` |\n| 05_Chat_New | `17:113` |\n| 06_Chat_Conversation | `19:174` |\n| 07_Export_PDF_Sheet | `20:238` |\n| 08_Profile_Settings | `19:257` |\n| 09_Account_Actions_Sheet | `20:333` |\n| 10_Theme_Sheet | `20:431` |\n| 11_Cloud_Space | `19:346` |\n| 12_Clear_Cache_Dialog | `20:527` |\n| Components · Chat Bot AI (section) | `12:2` |\n\n**Design system.** Brand `#612A74` throughout; Bricolage Grotesque for display and headings, Nunito for UI and body. Neutrals, semantic and storage colors, radii and elevation are defined once and reused: chats `#612A74`, images `#A87BC0`, exports `#E6C48D`, error `#C2455A`, surfaces white over `#F8F6FA` with `#E9E4EE` hairlines.\n\n**Components.** The given Button, Text Field, Status Bar and Home Indicator are instanced directly. The library adds 25 masters: primary, secondary, destructive, disabled, ghost and small buttons, active and default tabs, premium pill, two icon buttons, chat list item, image tile, export row, setting row, filled input, user and AI bubbles, suggestion card, message actions, section label, sheet, dialog and usage bar. Media instances (logo, avatar, generated images, PDF icon, Google/Facebook marks, icon set) are reused rather than redrawn.\n\n**Prototype.** 28 click reactions, all verified present: Login → Home (Login button and both social buttons); Home → New Topic, chat item, Images, Exports, avatar; Images and Exports → each other, New Topic, avatar; New Chat menu and back → Home; Conversation menu → Home and export → PDF sheet; PDF sheet close, Cancel and Export → Conversation; Profile back → Home, more → Account sheet, Theme → Theme sheet, Data & storage → Cloud Space; Account sheet Sign out → Login, Cancel and scrim → Profile; Theme Done and scrim → Profile; Cloud Space back → Profile, Clear cache → dialog; dialog Delete and Cancel → Cloud Space.\n\n**Limitations.**\n- Sheets and dialogs are separate top-level frames that render the parent screen underneath with a 45% scrim, linked by navigate. The API rejected overlay navigation, so they are not true Figma overlay layers.\n- The three scrollable screens show fixed-height compositions rather than configured scroll behaviour; everything the brief lists is visible within the frame, and the long story on 06 is clipped with a fade as permitted.\n- Two prototype writes only succeeded on a retry after an identical payload initially failed validation; the final audit confirms every link is stored."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":1379,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":233602,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1379}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"79e4a8c2-208e-41cc-9c26-d4519dca7846","uuid":"f4f949c1-4ad8-4933-851b-a9bc6a49a4c3","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:27:34.007Z"}
